
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>GBHS Kanali Management System</title>
<style>
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #f1f5f9;
  color: #172554;
}
header {
  background: #102b50;
  color: white;
  padding: 24px 18px;
  text-align: center;
}
header h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; }
main { padding: 18px; }
h3 { color: #166534; }
.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 12px;
}
.item {
  background: white;
  padding: 22px 10px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px #0001;
  font-weight: bold;
}
footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 20px;
  color: #64748b;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <h2>GBHS Kanali</h2>
  <div>School Management System</div>
  <p>WE MAKE WAYS</p>
</header>
<main>
  <h3>Welcome to School Dashboard</h3>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="item">👨‍🎓<br>Students</div>
    <div class="item">👨‍🏫<br>Teachers</div>
    <div class="item">📅<br>Attendance</div>
    <div class="item">📚<br>Exams & Results</div>
    <div class="item">💳<br>Student Fees</div>
    <div class="item">💰<br>School Finance</div>
    <div class="item">📊<br>Reports</div>
    <div class="item">⚙️<br>Settings</div>
  </div>
</main>
<footer>Government Boys High School Kanali</footer>
</body>
</html>
